  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>The University of Hull’s London campus is also known as the London Study Centre. The university launched the London Study Centre in 2024. Here, you can pursue various postgraduate programs in business, healthcare, and digital technologies.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>At the London Study Centre, you'll benefit from small class sizes, giving you personalised attention. You'll have full access to the University of Hull’s Study Skills resources, including webinars, self-access videos, and one-to-one tutorials. The Centre assists with learning, mental health, and assistive technology, ensuring you have a peaceful time on campus.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Facilities",
      "value": "<p><strong>Cafeteria</strong><br>The campus has new facilities, including a dedicated breakout space for relaxation and gatherings, a rooftop bar, and a café offering refreshments and light meals.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
